ery high  resolutions from many shots which the  crew later painted their CG images onto  CGT creature greeghan who's one of  balam's  deadly royal guards is a sort of seven  foot tall lizard with a 20 foot wingspan  and a whip-like tail to prepare for his  motion capture performers actor Aryan  Bukhari who portrays greeghan studied  the movements of lizards such as Komodo  dragons and aim to combine human  intelligence with a reptiles agility and  unpredictability the design of the  spaceships in Jupiter ascending was  influenced by the history of  Transportation and the fact that rich  people have always traveled in style  the Wachowski z' wanted to reflect this  by giving their spaceship a sense of  opulence they thought was generally  missing in sci-fi movies the film's  various spacecraft are sleek and agile  with designs inspired by nature for  example insects or birds of prey  production designer hue beta adapted the  hallways and display areas at London's  Natural History Museum to create the set  of colleagues Palace later gilded domes  and spires were added digitally the  chapel scene on Titus's ship was filmed  at Ely Cathedral in Cambridgeshire  England production designer hubei tup  combined the cathedral sandstone gothic  features with modern steel framed  windows structures and light fixtures  created by set decorator Peter Walpole  and the prop Department as for the  overall look of Titus's home that was  influenced by variety of styles  including gothic and Art Deco  architecture as well as the huge pillars  of Old English churches and the wood  finishes in brass or gold trim of mid  19th century luxury yachts balam's home  is a vast space which includes a lab and  refinery and brings to mind both a steel  mill and a supercollider to create that  world the crew constructed enormous sets  at Leavesden studios and the visual  effects team surrounded those sets with  floor-to-ceiling green screens balam's  world is a spin on gothic and industrial  styles with added opulence  well there you have it 12 things you  probably didn't know about Jupiter  ascending  tell me what's your favorite sci-fi  movie if you enjoyed this video hit the  thumbs up button and subscribe for more  things you didn't know plus weekly movie  reviews and interviews thanks for  watching  yippee-ki-yay movie lovers
 

